hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"24187","Yunus and Surayj narrated to us, they said: Fulayh narrated to us, from Said ibn al-Harith, from Abu Salamah, he said: Abu Hurayrah used to narrate from the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, that he said: In Friday is an hour, then he mentioned the hadith. I said: By Allah, if I come to Abu Said and ask him. Then he mentioned the hadith. Then I went out from him and entered upon Abdullah ibn Salam and asked about it. He said: Allah created Adam on Friday, sent him down to earth on Friday, took him on Friday, and in it the Hour will stand, and it is the last hour. Surayj said: It is the last of its hours. I said: The Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, said in prayer, and it is not a prayer hour. He said: Did you not know that the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, said: The waiter of prayer is in prayer? I said: Yes, it is, by Allah, it is."
